.TH smi-workflow-workspace-location "1" "May 2026" "SMI Toolset" "SMI Infra Command"
.SH NAME
smi-workflow-workspace-location \- Print the per-workflow working directory path
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B smi-workflow-workspace-location
.RI [ COUNTRY_CODE
.RI [ ORG_SHORT_NAME
.RI [ UUID ]]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B smi-workflow-workspace-location
returns the path to the per-workflow working directory under
\fB<org-root>/operations/workflows/<uuid>\fR.
.PP
Arguments default to the environment variables \fBSMI_CC\fR, \fBSMI_ORG\fR, and \fBSMI_WF_UUID\fR
respectively.
When called with no arguments and \fBSMI_WORKSPACE\fR is set, that value is returned instead
(UUID-only subPath mount pattern used in Argo Workflows).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SMI_CC
Default country code (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2).
.TP
.B SMI_ORG
Default organisation short name.
.TP
.B SMI_WF_UUID
Default workflow UUID.
.TP
.B SMI_WORKSPACE
When set and no arguments are given, this value is returned directly.
.SH AUTHOR
